  frozen still read final-payment-PI details for their own orders. Core
  commit 5de4246 fixes this using the same canonical-helper swap, plus a
  pgTAP regression (also not run).

A third, lower-severity occurrence of the identical drift (in the
support_ticket_set_customer_context() BEFORE INSERT trigger that actually
+governs submit_customer_support_ticket_v1's authorization) was found and
